# Current 12-Month Executive Coaching Program Overview

The 12-month executive coaching program is for senior leaders and founders who want a structured space to work on their leadership practice and priorities.

## Program structure and investment
- **Duration:** 12 months.
- **Monthly cadence:** One 60-minute coaching session plus one 30-minute practical application and training session.
- **Baseline assessments:** AQai Adaptability Assessment and Five-Mountain Leadership Assessment.
- **Core investment:** €5,400, payable in two installments of €2,700.
- **Optional asynchronous support:** €280 per month, available Tuesday and Thursday.
- **Additional individual sessions:** €450 per hour.

## Working focus
The coaching can examine priorities, communication, habits, and situations that require attention. The monthly practical session supports application in current work.

